{#
  Temperature runaway guard (hetero-rework integration spec §3.10).

  Atom loss already aborts LAMMPS; a configuration that blows up while keeping
  every atom does not, and spends its whole step budget before anyone reads the
  log. `fix halt` ends the run the first time the global temperature crosses
  `settings.simulation.halt_temperature_factor` x the target.

  `error continue`, not `error hard`: a blow-up is often specific to one load
  or pressure (unresolved forces at that contact), so it must cost only that
  point. The halt ends the current `run` and the script goes on; the
  `emit_halt_check` that follows each dynamic run sees the temperature still
  over the threshold, appends one line to the run's `halted.txt` registry and
  jumps past the point's `write_data` to the next loop iteration (a slide) or
  out of the ramp (system init: later loads ramp from the blown-up state, so
  they are abandoned, and the loads already written still slide).

  `halt_temperature` is None when the guard is off, and both macros then emit
  nothing at all.
#}
{% macro emit_temperature_halt(halt_temperature) %}
{% if halt_temperature is not none and halt_temperature %}
# --- runaway-temperature guard ----------------------------------------------
variable        halt_T equal temp
fix             halt_hot all halt 1000 v_halt_T > {{ halt_temperature }} error continue message yes
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{#
  After a dynamic run: if the guard fired (the run ended hot), record the point
  in `halt_record` and jump to `target`. `point` is the `key=value` text that
  names the point (`load=$(v_find) angle=$(v_a) speed=$(v_speed)`), parsed by
  `postprocessing.run_status.read_halt_registry`.
#}
{% macro emit_halt_check(halt_temperature, halt_record, stage, point, target) %}
{% if halt_temperature is not none and halt_temperature %}
if              "$(v_halt_T) > {{ halt_temperature }}" then &
                "print '# HALT stage={{ stage }} {{ point }} T=$(v_halt_T) step=$(step)' append {{ halt_record }} screen yes" &
                "jump SELF {{ target }}"
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
